      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいことを教えてやるぜ。\r\nこの牢の左の奥を調べてみな。",
        "official_en": "All right, so about that secret... You should check out the far left corner of this cell. Might find something interesting.",
        "real_en": "I'll tell you something useful. Check the back left of this cell."
      },
      "review": {
