        "official_en_sha256": "281d59fc95a894feb71c6d7bd7c98fc7aa8b5e0d81232c7a1e379e033ab7a896"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいものを安く売っていたんですけどねぇ。\r\nどうも、国としてはそれが邪魔だったようです。\r\n価格を統制したかったんでしょうねぇ。",
        "official_en": "I had been pricing my goods competitively, but I quickly learned that this country is hell-bent on dictating every last price tag.",
        "real_en": "I was selling good products cheaply, but apparently that got in the government's way. I guess they wanted to control prices."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
