      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いやはや、困りましたよ。\r\n商いをしていただけなのに捕まるなんて……。",
        "official_en": "Dear me, I was just doing some honest business...",
        "real_en": "What a mess... I was arrested just for running my business..."
