      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この牢に訪れし同胞よ。\r\n玉座の横を調べよ。",
        "official_en": "To my fellow inmates: if you make it out, check beside the throne.",
        "real_en": "To my comrades who come to this prison: check beside the throne."
