      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なにもかも増税のせいで\r\nまともな商売なんてできやしねぇ。\r\n戦争の準備がそんなに大切かねぇ？",
        "official_en": "Who can make a living with those taxes? What war is worth all this?",
        "real_en": "With these tax hikes, you can't do business properly anymore. Is preparing for war really so important?"
