        "official_en_sha256": "067a75cfa5887151954282250f908e822c710da0fe1654d2fa920ec83eb53192"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "わたしゃ、ソゼ皇帝が通ったお店で\r\n働いていたからよ～く知っとるんじゃ。",
        "official_en": "I used to work at a place Emperor Sozhe frequented, so trust me when I say I know a lot about him.",
