        "official_en_sha256": "4c5f902c8a31e6c75a6ae2124a7efa024a9ebb7703e75dd1d8af98131e06d61d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "シエラ皇太子は\r\n私や反乱軍に危害が及ばないよう、\r\nご自身の危険も顧みずに黙秘を続けております。",
        "official_en": "Prince Shera remains silent. He’s disregarded his own safety to protect me and the rebel forces from harm.",
        "real_en": "Crown Prince Shera remains silent. He’s disregarded his own safety to protect me and the rebel forces from harm."
      },
