      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今から言うのはただのひとりごとだ。\r\n玉座の横を調べてみろ……。",
        "official_en": "You didn’t hear this from me, but if I were you, I’d check beside the throne.",
        "real_en": "I'm just talking to myself here. Try checking beside the throne..."
