        "official_en_sha256": "22c1a950ad3f2302754fbb924ba263ab93c90c79a0c09ac00e181939e4f4f1e2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺は列車の警備兵だったんだがな。\r\n皇帝の虫の居所が悪かったのか\r\n投獄されちまった。",
        "official_en": "I used to be a train guard. Not sure what I did to land myself in here, but whatever it was must’ve royally pissed off the emperor.",
        "real_en": "I used to guard the trains. Maybe the emperor was in a foul mood, but I got thrown in prison."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
