        "official_en_sha256": "d02345daee4f2e69cf8951f50edb4607055d1c9d6d8b39951b406209a79a0ef9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺は帝都の店で働いていたんだがな。\r\n増税がひどすぎて、それに文句をつけたら\r\nそれだけで投獄されちまった。",
        "official_en": "I own a shop in the capital, but they locked me up just because I had the gall to complain about the tax hikes. Can you believe it?",
        "real_en": "I worked at a shop in the capital. I complained about the huge tax increases, and that alone got me thrown into prison."
      },
      "review": {
