        "official_en_sha256": "a7d1cc00ed2452cfc62fa71770649bd9cd7395c5e68961fecd1345eca9a717ea"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "助けに来てくれたのかい？\r\n隙を見て脱出するよ、ありがとう。",
        "official_en": "You’ve come to get me out? Thank you. I’ll try sneaking past the guards when I have the chance.",
        "real_en": "Did you come to rescue me? Thank you. I'll escape when I get the chance."
